'''Gentleman Bros.''' (ネコ紳士同盟 ''Neko Shinshi Dōmei'', "'''Gentleman Alliance Cats'''") is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Evil Cat Awakes!|Evil Cat Awakens!]] and [[Infernal Tower]]. They were added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gentleman Bros.
|appearance = [[Evil Cat Awakes!]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 19|Infernal Tower - Floor 19]]
|image = E 231.png
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, long range, decent damage and attack rate, and a 100% chance to freeze Cat Units.

==Strategy==
Although they have very high range and the Freeze ability, their uptime is less than 50% meaning that units with less than 500 range still have a chance against them. Rushers are effective as well because Gentleman Bros' attack power is not that great either. If you do own any units with above 500 range, they will be very useful against it.

